Complete pixel-level UI/UX and frontend engineering specification
The image depicts a premium, dark-themed agricultural farm management dashboard, specifically the My Farms overview page. The interface is designed to look like a sophisticated enterprise SaaS platform, combining a nature-inspired visual identity, translucent glassmorphism, photographic agricultural backgrounds, luminous green accents, and a structured data-management interface.

The following specification breaks down the screenshot into its individual visual layers, components, dimensions, spacing, colors, typography, interactions, background treatments, borders, shadows, and responsive implementation requirements.

The objective is to make it possible for a frontend developer to reconstruct the interface from scratch using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with the closest possible visual match to the reference.

